---
// src/components/Throughline.astro
---
<section class="py-24">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400 mb-5">
            The Throughline
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-8">
            The engineer never left. He just changed what he optimizes.
        </h2>
        <div class="text-lg text-slate-300 space-y-6 text-left">
            <p>
                I started in metallurgical engineering, learning to reason about systems and evidence before I ever wrote a headline. Marketing turned out to be the same discipline with a different surface: form a hypothesis, instrument it, read the data, iterate.
            </p>
            <p>
                Today I run organic growth for a global exchange and build the tools that make it measurable &mdash; and I'm formalizing that quantitative instinct through graduate study in Operations Research.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
            <a href="/about" class="inline-block border border-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
                More about me
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
